376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 293 0 R
/T (The Pre-Event Surge \(London 2012\): The mere announcement of a mega-event drives immediate equity. Following the 2012 announcement, London saw a 2.1% baseline property increase, but assets within a 3-mile radius of the main stadium locked in a sustained 5% price premium.)
/E (The Pre-Event Surge \(London 2012\): The mere announcement of a mega-event drives immediate equity. Following the 2012 announcement, London saw a 2.1% baseline property increase, but assets within a 3-mile radius of the main stadium locked in a sustained 5% price premium.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
