/S /H2
/P 293 0 R
/T (The Post-Event Crash \(Barcelona 1992\): Speculation is dangerous. Leading up to the 1992 Games, Barcelona real estate surged an unsustainable 131%. When the event ended, the market suffered a 50% collapse, nearly erasing all pre-event gains.)
/E (The Post-Event Crash \(Barcelona 1992\): Speculation is dangerous. Leading up to the 1992 Games, Barcelona real estate surged an unsustainable 131%. When the event ended, the market suffered a 50% collapse, nearly erasing all pre-event gains.)
